#: ../../usage.md:1
msgid "Interaction"
msgstr "交互"

#: ../../usage.md:3
msgid ""
"minacode runs as a conversation in your terminal. You type a request, the"
" agent works through it with [tools](tools.md), and you stay in the loop "
"the whole time — steering, answering questions, and reviewing changes."
msgstr ""
"minacode 以终端对话的形式运行。你输入任务，agent "
"使用[工具](tools.md)完成工作；整个过程中你都可以继续引导、回答问题并审查修改。"

#: ../../usage.md:7
msgid "Follow-ups"
msgstr "追加指令"

#: ../../usage.md:9
msgid ""
"You can keep typing while minacode works. A submitted follow-up joins the"
" current task if another model step begins; otherwise it becomes the next"
" task. A draft still in the editor is never submitted by interrupting — "
"the first `Ctrl-C` discards it instead."
msgstr ""
"minacode 工作时仍可继续输入。如果又开始了一个模型 "
"step，提交的追加指令会加入当前任务；否则会成为下一个任务。中断不会提交编辑器中尚未发送的草稿——第一次 `Ctrl-C` 会先丢弃它。"

#: ../../usage.md:15
msgid ""
"A `+` below the divider is waiting for the next model step. At that "
"boundary — after the current tool-call batch, when there is one — all "
"waiting follow-ups are sent together, in order, with the next model "
"request and move above the divider as normal user messages. They remain "
"retryable internally until that request completes successfully; a failed "
"request moves them back below the divider as queued input."
msgstr ""
"分隔线下以 `+` 开头的消息正在等待下一个模型 step。到达该边界时——如果存在当前 tool-call "
"批次，则先等待它结束——所有等待中的追加指令会按顺序随下一次模型请求一起发送，并作为普通用户消息移到分隔线上方。在请求成功结束前，它们仍会在内部保留以供安全重试；请求失败时则会重新回到分隔线下方的队列中。"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "When"
msgstr "使用时机"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`Enter`"
msgstr "`Enter`"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "While the agent works"
msgstr "Agent 工作时"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Queue a follow-up for the next model step"
msgstr "将追加指令排入下一个模型 step"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`Ctrl-C`"
msgstr "`Ctrl-C`"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid ""
"Discard a draft in the editor; with the editor empty, interrupt the task "
"— retracting the message if the agent has not answered yet, or recording "
"the interrupt once it has"
msgstr "丢弃编辑器中的草稿；编辑器为空时中断任务——若 agent 尚未回答则撤回该消息，若已回答则记录这次中断"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Idle prompt"
msgstr "空闲 prompt"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Clear input line"
msgstr "清空输入行"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`Ctrl-U`"
msgstr "`Ctrl-U`"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Any prompt"
msgstr "任意提示符"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Clear the whole input line, leaving the turn running"
msgstr "清空整行输入，当前 turn 继续运行"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`Up` / `Ctrl-P`"
msgstr "`Up` / `Ctrl-P`"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "While working, with an empty editor"
msgstr "Agent 工作且编辑器为空时"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Recall the newest queued message"
msgstr "取回最新的排队消息"

#: ../../usage.md:29
msgid ""
"Interrupting splits two ways. If the agent has not answered yet, `Ctrl-C`"
" *retracts* the message: it is discarded and never reaches the "
"conversation record or the saved session, as if it was never sent (your "
"input history still recalls it with `Ctrl-P`). Once the agent has spoken "
"or run a tool, `Ctrl-C` *interrupts*: the work already shown stays, and "
"the turn is marked as interrupted so minacode knows it ended early."
msgstr ""
"中断分两种情况。如果 agent 尚未回答，`Ctrl-C` 会*撤回*该消息：它被丢弃，不会进入对话记录或保存的 "
"session，就像从未发送过一样（输入历史仍可用 `Ctrl-P` 召回）。一旦 agent 已经开口或运行过工具，`Ctrl-C` "
"会*中断*：已经展示的内容保留，该轮被标记为已中断，让 minacode 知道它提前结束了。"

#: ../../usage.md:35
msgid "Streaming model output"
msgstr "模型流式输出"

#: ../../usage.md:37
msgid ""
"Model output streams by default in the interactive terminal over OpenAI-"
"compatible Chat Completions, OpenAI Responses, and Anthropic Messages. "
"Text appears as it arrives above the divider, and the divider names the "
"phase: `thinking` while the model reasons, if it exposes reasoning at "
"all, then `responding` while it writes the answer."
msgstr ""
"在交互式终端里，模型输出默认是流式的，覆盖 OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completions、OpenAI Responses 和 "
"Anthropic Messages。文本随着到达显示在分隔线上方，分隔线则标出当前阶段：模型推理时是 "
"`thinking`（前提是它会给出推理内容），写回答时是 `responding`。"

#: ../../usage.md:44
msgid ""
"The live text is a bounded preview, not a second conversation entry. On "
"completion it clears and the final answer is rendered once in the normal "
"Rich transcript. Tool-call arguments stay buffered until the call is "
"complete, so partial JSON never appears as user-facing output. No "
"streaming setting is required for the usual case; endpoints that reject "
"streaming can disable it with `provider.stream = false` or `/set "
"provider.stream off`."
msgstr ""
"实时文本只是有界预览，并非第二条对话记录。完成后预览会清空，最终回答只在正常的 Rich transcript "
"中渲染一次。工具调用参数会一直缓冲到调用完整，因此不会把不完整的 JSON 展示给用户。通常无需配置流式输出；如果 endpoint "
"拒绝流式请求，可设置 `provider.stream = false` 或执行 `/set provider.stream off`。"

#: ../../usage.md:50
msgid "Bash output"
msgstr "Bash 输出"

#: ../../usage.md:52
msgid ""
"While Bash runs, its live output stays above the `working` divider. When "
"the command finishes, up to three lines from each stream stay in the "
"transcript, and the complete result is stored under its `tr.N` key."
msgstr ""
"Bash 运行期间，它的实时输出停留在 `working` 分隔线上方。命令结束后，每个输出流会各保留最多三行在对话记录里，完整结果则存放在它的 "
"`tr.N` 键下。"

#: ../../usage.md:56
msgid ""
"Press `Ctrl-O` to browse the 50 most recent results, newest first: "
"`j`/`k` or the arrows select, `/` searches, `Enter` opens, and `Ctrl-O` "
"or `q` closes. Long lists scroll inside a window about ten rows tall, and"
" a counter under it says which rows you are looking at. Opening one shows"
" what was run above what it returned, in a read-only scrolling viewer — a"
" Bash command with both its streams, a `ToolScript` with its complete "
"script and result, or a delegation order with the worker's answer below "
"it. For a script this is the only way to read it under `--yolo`, where no"
" confirmation prompt stops to offer `v`; for an order it is where you "
"judge the answer against what was actually asked, since the transcript "
"keeps only the `Delegate send` line."
msgstr ""
"按 `Ctrl-O` 可以按时间倒序浏览最近 50 条结果：`j`/`k` 或方向键选择，`/` 搜索，`Enter` 打开，`Ctrl-O` 或"
" `q` "
"关闭。列表较长时会在大约十行高的窗口里滚动，下方的计数说明当前看到的是哪几行。打开后会在只读的可滚动查看器里，把执行的内容显示在它返回的结果之上 "
"—— Bash 是命令与它的两个输出流，`ToolScript` 是完整脚本与结果，委派 order 则是 order 本身与下方 worker "
"的回答。对脚本来说，这是在 `--yolo` 下读到它的唯一途径，因为那里没有确认提示会停下来提供 `v`；对 order "
"来说，这是拿回答与当初真正的要求相互对照的地方，因为记录里只留下了 `Delegate send` 那一行。"

#: ../../usage.md:65
msgid ""
"A `ToolScript` that is **running right now** leads the list, marked "
"`running` instead of a `tr.N` key. A long batch is exactly when its "
"script is worth reading, and until it returns there is no stored result "
"to open. It leaves the list when the batch finishes and its real entry "
"takes over."
msgstr ""
"正在运行的 `ToolScript` 会排在列表最前面，标的是 `running` 而不是 "
"`tr.N`。一批长任务恰恰是最该读一读它脚本的时候，而在它返回之前并没有已存下的结果可打开。批次结束后它会离开列表，由真正的那一条接手。"

#: ../../usage.md:69
msgid ""
"Very large results are bounded rather than rendered whole: the viewer "
"keeps the head and tail of a long result and clips individual lines past "
"~1000 characters, and the header says so whenever it did. Nothing is lost"
" — the complete result stays under its `tr.N` key."
msgstr ""
"超大的结果不会整份渲染，而是加以限制：查看器保留长结果的开头与结尾，并把超过约 1000 "
"字符的单行截断，只要发生过，头部就会写明。没有任何内容丢失 —— 完整结果仍保存在它的 `tr.N` 键下。"

#: ../../usage.md:75
msgid "Status bar"
msgstr "状态栏"

#: ../../usage.md:77
msgid ""
"A single line beneath the prompt summarizes the runtime: the active "
"provider and model, the reasoning level, context fill with the latest "
"request's cache ratio as `ctx 23% · cache 98%`, the code index state, and"
" any background jobs. MCP and skill counts and an update notice appear "
"when relevant."
msgstr ""
"提示符下方的一行概括了运行状态：当前 provider 与模型、推理强度、上下文占用以及最近一次请求的缓存命中率（形如 `ctx 23% · "
"cache 98%`）、代码索引状态，以及正在运行的后台作业。MCP 与 skill 数量、以及更新提示会在相关时出现。"

#: ../../usage.md:82
msgid ""
"The cache ratio fills in after the first request and refreshes with each "
"response. `/status` reports the same figures for the whole session."
msgstr "缓存命中率会在第一次请求之后出现，并随每次响应刷新。`/status` 会给出整个会话的同类数字。"

#: ../../usage.md:85
msgid ""
"While the agent works, the role colors give way to a blue-to-purple sweep"
" that scrolls across the line, and the live counters join it: a retry or "
"attempt notice, and the `step N/M` counter once the turn reaches the "
"final fifth of `max_agent_steps`, signaling that the turn is about to be "
"cut off."
msgstr ""
"agent 工作时，角色色会让位于一道蓝到紫的扫光，扫过整行，并加入实时计数：重试或尝试提示，以及当本轮步数进入 "
"`max_agent_steps` 的最后五分之一时出现的 `step N/M` 计数，提示本轮即将被截断。"

#: ../../usage.md:90
msgid ""
"A `[compaction]` marker leads the line while a summary runs, so the pause"
" reads as compaction rather than as a slow reply."
msgstr "摘要运行期间，整行会以 `[compaction]` 标记开头，这样这段等待读起来就是压缩，而不是一次很慢的回复。"

#: ../../usage.md:93
msgid ""
"The working divider above the prompt names the current phase — "
"`thinking`, `responding`, or `web search` while a [provider-side "
"tool](tools.md#provider-side-tools) runs inside the request — with the "
"time spent so far beside it, and an estimated output speed while text is "
"arriving: `responding (12s · ↓ 48 tok/s)`. The `↓` marks the speed as the"
" model's incoming stream; it is still an estimate, and it disappears "
"between requests and on providers that do not stream."
msgstr ""
"提示符上方的 working 分隔线会写出当前阶段 -- "
"`thinking`、`responding`，或在请求内部运行[服务端工具](tools.md#provider-side-tools) 时的 "
"`web search` -- 旁边是已经花掉的时间，并在有文本到达时给出输出速度：`responding (12s · ↓ 48 "
"tok/s)`。`↓` 标记这是模型的下行速率；它仍是估算值，请求之间以及不支持流式的 provider 上不会显示。"

#: ../../usage.md:101
msgid "Quick hints"
msgstr "快捷提示"

#: ../../usage.md:103
msgid ""
"After an answer, the model may suggest two or three next steps as chips "
"under the prompt. They are suggestions, not commands: ignore them and "
"keep typing, or take one. Each suggestion sits on its own line, so every "
"one stays visible even on a narrow terminal."
msgstr "回答之后，模型可能会在提示符下面以 chip 的形式给出两三个下一步，每个建议单独占一行，即使终端很窄也能全部看到。它们只是建议，不是命令：可以不理会继续打字，也可以选一个。"

#: ../../usage.md:109
msgid ""
"`Tab` cycles between the input and the chips. `Enter` on a chip picks it "
"into the input and returns to the prompt, so `Tab` to the next chip and "
"`Enter` again combines several suggestions; a final `Enter` sends. Focus "
"a picked chip and press `Enter` to unpick it. Editing the text normally "
"clears the chip selection state. Quick hints are always available at the "
"TUI prompt."
msgstr ""
"`Tab` 在输入框和 chip 之间循环切换。在 chip 上按 `Enter` 可将它选入输入框并返回提示符，因此 `Tab` 移到下一个 "
"chip 再按 `Enter` 即可组合多条建议；最后按一次 `Enter` 发送。重新聚焦已选中的 chip 并按 `Enter` "
"可取消选中。正常编辑文本会清除 chip 选择状态。快速建议会在 TUI 提示符中始终可用。"

#: ../../usage.md:114
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../usage.md:116
msgid ""
"Type `/` commands at the prompt to inspect state, switch models, manage "
"the session, or configure runtime behavior on the fly. See the [command "
"reference](commands.md) for the full list, or run `/help` in a session."
msgstr ""
"在 prompt 中输入 `/` 命令，可以查看状态、切换模型、管理 session 或即时修改 runtime "
"行为。完整列表见[命令参考](commands.md)，或在 session 中运行 `/help`。"

#: ../../usage.md:120
msgid "Mentions"
msgstr "引用"

#: ../../usage.md:122
msgid ""
"Mentions pull something into the turn. Type `@` at the prompt for a list "
"of the three kinds; picking one opens its candidates, which narrow as you"
" keep typing."
msgstr "引用会把某样东西带入本轮对话。在 prompt 中输入 `@` 即可列出三种引用；选中其中一种后会打开它的候选项，并随着继续输入不断收窄。"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Mention"
msgstr "引用"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Also written"
msgstr "等价写法"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`@file:path`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "—"
msgstr ""

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Points the agent at a file in the project"
msgstr "让 agent 关注项目中的一个文件"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`@mcp:server`, `@mcp:server.tool`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`@server`, `@server.tool`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../usage.md
msgid ""
"Connects an [MCP](mcp.md) server on demand and points the agent at that "
"server or tool. <span class=\"marker\">The connection remains active "
"until you disconnect it.</span>"
msgstr ""
"按需连接 [MCP](mcp.md) server，并让 agent 关注该 server 或工具。<span "
"class=\"marker\">连接会保持，直到主动断开。</span>"

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`@skill:name`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "`$name`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../usage.md
msgid "Injects a [skill](skills.md)'s full instructions into the current turn"
msgstr "将 [skill](skills.md) 的完整指令注入当前一轮"

#: ../../usage.md:133
msgid ""
"**Files.** Small in-workspace files are inlined as a FILE MENTIONS block;"
" large ones and anything outside the workspace become a pointer telling "
"the agent to Read it. A missing path reports itself instead of being "
"silently dropped."
msgstr ""
"**文件。** 工作区内的小文件会以内联形式作为 FILE MENTIONS 块进入本轮对话；大文件以及工作区之外的文件会变成提示，告诉 "
"agent 用 Read 读取。路径缺失时会自行报告，而不会静默丢弃。"

#: ../../usage.md:137
msgid ""
"**Picking files.** Files stay out of the first `@` list: typing or "
"selecting `@file:` opens fzf immediately, and `Tab` does the same from an"
" active file mention. Without fzf, a bounded literal fallback runs in the"
" background. Candidates include hidden, tracked, and untracked files, but"
" never `.git` directories or paths ignored by Git; in a non-Git "
"directory, nested `.gitignore` files and negation rules are honored. A "
"path with spaces, Unicode, or ambiguous punctuation is inserted in a "
"quoted, round-trippable form such as `@file:\"docs/design "
"notes/中文.txt\"`."
msgstr ""
"**选择文件。** 文件不出现在 `@` 的第一层列表里：输入或选择 `@file:` 会立即打开 fzf，在已有文件引用上按 `Tab` "
"也是如此。没有 fzf 时，会在后台运行一个有界的字面匹配 fallback。候选包含隐藏文件、已跟踪文件和未跟踪文件，但绝不包含 `.git` "
"目录和被 Git 忽略的路径；在非 Git 目录中，会遵循嵌套的 `.gitignore` 文件及其 negation "
"规则。带空格、Unicode 或歧义标点的路径会以可往返解析的引号形式插入，例如 `@file:\"docs/design "
"notes/中文.txt\"`。"

#: ../../usage.md:144
msgid ""
"Mentions are expanded in follow-ups queued while the agent is working, "
"too."
msgstr "Agent 工作期间排队的 follow-up 中，引用同样会被展开。"

#: ../../usage.md:146
msgid "Keys and input editing"
msgstr "按键与输入编辑"

#: ../../usage.md:148
msgid ""
"**Interactive selectors** (model picker, MCP manager, diff viewer) "
"support:"
msgstr "**交互式选择器**（模型选择器、MCP 管理器、diff viewer）支持："

#: ../../usage.md:150
msgid "`j` / `k` or arrow keys to move"
msgstr "使用 `j` / `k` 或方向键移动"

#: ../../usage.md:151
msgid "`g` / `G` to jump to top / bottom"
msgstr "使用 `g` / `G` 跳到顶部或底部"

#: ../../usage.md:152
msgid "`/` to search, `Enter` to accept, `Esc` to cancel"
msgstr "使用 `/` 搜索，`Enter` 确认，`Esc` 取消"

#: ../../usage.md:154
msgid "**The input line** supports:"
msgstr "**输入行**支持："

#: ../../usage.md:156
msgid "history recall and completion"
msgstr "历史记录与补全"

#: ../../usage.md:157
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-C` — clear the current input; with the input empty while running, "
"interrupt the turn (retracting it if the agent has not answered yet)"
msgstr "`Ctrl-C` — 清空当前输入；运行时若输入为空则中断当前轮（若 agent 尚未回答则撤回它）"

#: ../../usage.md:158
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-U` — clear the whole input line, in the idle prompt and the follow-"
"up editor alike"
msgstr "`Ctrl-U` — 清空整行输入，空闲提示符和后续消息编辑器中行为一致"

#: ../../usage.md:159
msgid "`Ctrl-D` — exit from an empty prompt"
msgstr "`Ctrl-D` — 在空 prompt 中退出"

#: ../../usage.md:160
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-R` — reverse-search your history; `Enter` puts the match in the "
"input to edit, a second `Enter` sends it"
msgstr "`Ctrl-R` —— 反向搜索历史；`Enter` 把匹配放进输入框供你修改，再按一次 `Enter` 才发送"

#: ../../usage.md:162
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-O` — browse recent Bash outputs, ToolScript scripts, and delegation"
" orders in full; press it again to close"
msgstr "`Ctrl-O` — 完整浏览最近的 Bash 输出、ToolScript 脚本与委派 order；再次按下即可关闭"

#: ../../usage.md:164
msgid ""
"`Ctrl-X Ctrl-E` or `Ctrl-G` — edit the current input in `$VISUAL` / "
"`$EDITOR` (falls back to vim), as a temporary Markdown file"
msgstr ""
"`Ctrl-X Ctrl-E` 或 `Ctrl-G` —— 在 `$VISUAL` / `$EDITOR`（回退到 "
"vim）里编辑当前输入，内容是一个临时的 Markdown 文件"

#: ../../usage.md:167
msgid "Editing a follow-up message in an external editor"
msgstr "在外部编辑器中编辑追加指令"

#: ../../usage.md:172
msgid "Typing a follow-up message in an external editor."
msgstr "在外部编辑器中输入追加指令。"

#: ../../usage.md:175
msgid ""
"When you open the editor in reply to the agent, its most recent reply is "
"appended below a git-style scissors line, so you can read what you are "
"answering while you compose (the full-screen editor hides that "
"scrollback):"
msgstr ""
"当你在回复 agent 时打开编辑器，它最近一次的回复会被追加到一条 git "
"风格剪刀线下方，方便你在撰写时阅读所要回答的内容（全屏编辑器会遮住那部分滚动历史）："

#: ../../usage.md:179
msgid ""
"Everything from the scissors line down is stripped before the message is "
"sent; a scissors line you type yourself is left untouched. Long replies "
"are capped to their most recent lines."
msgstr "剪刀线及其下方的所有内容都会在消息发送前被剥离；你自己输入的剪刀线则原样保留。过长的回复只保留最近的若干行。"

#: ../../usage.md:181
msgid "Image input"
msgstr "图片输入"

#: ../../usage.md:183
msgid ""
"Paste or type the path of an existing local image directly into the "
"prompt. minacode replaces the path with an inline label such as `[Image "
"#1 · screenshot.png]`, so you can see exactly which images will be "
"submitted while continuing to edit the surrounding text. Relative paths "
"resolve from the workspace; quoted paths and backslash-escaped spaces are"
" accepted."
msgstr ""
"可直接在 prompt 中粘贴或输入现有本地图片的路径。minacode 会将路径替换为类似 `[Image #1 · "
"screenshot.png]` 的内联标签，因此你可以清楚看到将要提交哪些图片，并继续编辑周围的文字。相对路径以 workspace "
"为基准；带引号的路径和使用反斜杠转义空格的路径也可以识别。"

#: ../../usage.md:190
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"PNG, JPEG, WebP, and single-frame GIF files are supported. minacode first"
" sends images using the selected standard API. If that request is "
"rejected and a [vision model](configuration.md#vision-model) is "
"configured, the image is described there and the same turn retries "
"without image blocks; a successful retry is remembered for later images. "
"Queued follow-ups, resumed sessions, and providers with image input "
"disabled keep readable image labels. See "
"[`provider.image_input`](configuration.md#optional-provider-settings) to "
"override automatic detection."
msgstr ""
"支持 PNG、JPEG、WebP 和单帧 GIF。minacode 会先使用所选的标准 API 发送图片。如果请求被拒绝且配置了 [vision "
"model](configuration.md#vision-"
"model)，图片会由视觉模型描述，并在不包含图片块的情况下重试同一回合；重试成功后会用于后续图片。排队的追加指令、恢复后的 "
"session，以及禁用图片输入的 provider 都会保留可读的图片标签。可以通过 "
"[`provider.image_input`](configuration.md#optional-provider-settings) "
"覆盖自动检测。"

#: ../../usage.md:197
msgid "Sessions"
msgstr "Session"

#: ../../usage.md:199
msgid ""
"<span class=\"marker\">Your work is saved automatically</span> — the "
"conversation, edits, and diffs are tied to the project directory you "
"started in, so an interrupted session picks up where it stopped. Sessions"
" untouched for seven days are removed by default, swept in the background"
" when minacode starts; it reports how many it removed. Resuming a session"
" resets its clock, so one you keep returning to is never removed. Set "
"`runtime.session_retention_days = 0` to keep them indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"marker\">工作会自动保存</span>：对话、编辑和 diff "
"都与启动时所在的项目目录关联，因此中断后可以从原处继续。默认会删除超过七天未被使用的 session，清理在 minacode "
"启动时于后台进行，并会报告删除了多少个。恢复某个 session 会重置它的计时，因此经常使用的 session 不会被删除。设置 "
"`runtime.session_retention_days = 0` 可永久保留。"

#: ../../usage.md:206
msgid "Resume from the command line:"
msgstr "从命令行恢复："

#: ../../usage.md:215
msgid ""
"Sessions are stored per project, so `-c` and a bare `--resume` never "
"reach into another project's history — even when your most recent session"
" anywhere was somewhere else. A `UID` is looked up across every project, "
"so you can resume one by id from wherever you are."
msgstr ""
"Session 按项目分开存储，因此 `-c` 和不带参数的 `--resume` 不会读取其他项目的历史，即使你最近一次 session "
"发生在别处也是如此。而 `UID` 会在所有项目中查找，所以你可以在任意目录下按 id 恢复某个 session。"

#: ../../usage.md:219
msgid ""
"A name or id prefix is searched in the current project first, then "
"everywhere — you can resume a session by name after moving directories. "
"When a query matches more than one session, minacode <span "
"class=\"marker\">lists the candidates instead of guessing</span> between "
"them."
msgstr ""
"名称或 id 前缀会先在当前项目内查找，再扩大到全部项目——因此换了目录之后仍可以按名称恢复。当一个查询匹配到多个 session "
"时，minacode 会<span class=\"marker\">列出候选而不是替你猜</span>。"

#: ../../usage.md:223
msgid ""
"Resuming replays the conversation into your scrollback, including the "
"diff each edit made. Long diffs are trimmed there; `/diff` always has the"
" full text."
msgstr ""
"恢复 session 时会把对话重新输出到终端回滚缓冲区，其中也包含每次编辑产生的 diff。这里的长 diff 会被截断；`/diff` "
"中始终保留完整内容。"

#: ../../usage.md:226
msgid "Names"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../usage.md:228
msgid ""
"Every session has a name, so you have something to recognize it by later."
" It starts as the first line you typed, becomes the agent's current goal "
"once it has one, and stays whatever you set with `/name`:"
msgstr ""
"每个 session 都有名称，方便日后辨认。它最初取自你输入的第一行，在 agent 确定目标之后改用该目标，一旦你用 `/name` "
"设置过，就固定为你设置的名称："

#: ../../usage.md:237
msgid ""
"A name is a label, not an identity — sessions may share one, and the id "
"is what makes each unique. Names are decided once rather than re-read "
"from the conversation, so a session you found under one name yesterday is"
" still under it today, even after its early messages have been compacted "
"away."
msgstr ""
"名称是标签而非身份：多个 session 可以同名，真正唯一的是 id。名称只决定一次，不会每次都从对话里重新推导，所以昨天以某个名称找到的 "
"session，今天仍在那个名称下，即使它早期的消息已被压缩清理。"

#: ../../usage.md:241
msgid "Switching sessions"
msgstr "切换 session"

#: ../../usage.md:243
msgid ""
"`/sessions` — or `/resume`, the same command — lists what is saved, "
"newest first, with how long ago each was touched and how many rounds it "
"ran. Type to filter across names and opening lines, and press Enter to "
"re-enter one:"
msgstr ""
"`/sessions`——或者 `/resume`，同一条命令——按最近使用顺序列出已保存的 "
"session，并显示各自的最后活动时间与轮数。输入内容即可在名称和开场消息中过滤，回车进入选中的 session："

#: ../../usage.md:249
msgid ""
"`/sessions all` widens the list past the current project, adding each "
"session's directory to its row. Choosing a session ends the current one —"
" it is saved first — and starts the next in its place, exactly as if you "
"had launched with `--resume`. Choosing the session you are already in, or"
" pressing `Esc`, changes nothing."
msgstr ""
"`/sessions all` 会把列表扩大到当前项目之外，并在每行补上该 session 所在的目录。选择一个 session 会结束当前 "
"session（先保存），再以它开始下一个，效果与用 `--resume` 启动完全一致。选中你已经身处的那个 session，或者按 "
"`Esc`，都不会有任何变化。"

#: ../../usage.md:254
msgid ""
"Run it from the prompt between turns. While the agent is working, "
"minacode says so and asks you to press `Ctrl-C` first: switching sessions"
" mid-turn would abandon a request already in flight."
msgstr ""
"请在两轮任务之间于提示符处运行它。agent 正在工作时，minacode 会提示你先按 `Ctrl-C`：在一轮任务进行中切换 "
"session，会丢弃已经发出的请求。"

#: ../../usage.md:257
msgid ""
"Sessions saved before names existed list under their id until the next "
"time they are saved."
msgstr "在名称功能出现之前保存的 session 会以 id 列出，直到它们下一次被保存。"

#: ../../usage.md:259
msgid "Reviewing changes"
msgstr "审查修改"

#: ../../usage.md:261
msgid "`/diff` opens an interactive, tabbed viewer with two views:"
msgstr "`/diff` 会打开带 tab 的交互式 viewer，包含两个视图："

#: ../../usage.md:263
msgid "**Latest** — what changed during the most recent round of your requests"
msgstr "**Latest** — 最近一轮请求产生的修改"

#: ../../usage.md:264
msgid "**Session** — the net diff for everything since the session began"
msgstr "**Session** — 从 session 开始至今的净 diff"

#: ../../usage.md:266
msgid "Navigate with `j`/`k`, `g`/`G`, and `/` search; press `Esc` to close."
msgstr "使用 `j`/`k`、`g`/`G` 和 `/` 搜索进行导航；按 `Esc` 关闭。"

#: ../../usage.md:268
msgid "Interactive diff list showing changed files from the latest turn"
msgstr "交互式 diff 列表显示最近一轮修改的文件"

#: ../../usage.md:273
msgid "Choosing a file to diff."
msgstr "选择要查看 diff 的文件。"

#: ../../usage.md:276
msgid "Side-by-side file diff with syntax highlighting"
msgstr "带语法高亮的并排文件 diff"

#: ../../usage.md:281
msgid "Side-by-side detail view of a changed file."
msgstr "文件 diff 的并排详情视图。"

#: ../../usage.md:284
msgid "Long sessions"
msgstr "长 session"

#: ../../usage.md:286
msgid ""
"minacode keeps long conversations within a working budget on its own, "
"summarizing older context as needed so a session can run indefinitely. "
"Run `/compact` to trim it now, or `/status` to see current context and "
"token usage."
msgstr ""
"minacode 会按需总结较早的 context，自动将长对话控制在可工作预算内，因此 session 可以持续运行。使用 `/compact`"
" 立即压缩，或使用 `/status` 查看当前 context 和 token 使用情况。"

