#~ msgid "Two inline references, both Tab-completed as you type:"
#~ msgstr "支持两种行内引用，输入时均可按 Tab 补全："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Tab` cycles the highlight, `Enter` puts"
#~ " the highlighted chip in the input"
#~ " where you can edit it, and a"
#~ " second `Enter` sends it. `/hints` "
#~ "turns them off for the session, "
#~ "`[runtime] quick_hints` for good."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Tab` 循环切换高亮，`Enter` 会把高亮的 chip 放进输入框供你修改，再按一次"
#~ " `Enter` 才发送。`/hints` 关闭本次会话的提示，`[runtime] "
#~ "quick_hints` 则长期关闭。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Typing `@` alone lists the three "
#~ "kinds; the menu merges files, MCP "
#~ "servers, and skills as you type, "
#~ "and completing always inserts the "
