#~ msgstr "单独输入 `@` 会列出三种类型；菜单会随输入合并文件、MCP server 与 skill 的匹配项，补全时总是插入带命名空间的形式。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Typing `@` alone lists the three "
#~ "kinds and completing one immediately "
#~ "opens its own candidate list. MCP "
#~ "and skill candidates narrow as you "
#~ "keep typing. Repository files are "
#~ "deliberately not merged into the first"
#~ " menu: after a brief pause in "
#~ "`@file:<query>`, minacode opens one real "
#~ "fzf session with the query prefilled."
#~ " `Tab` remains an optional way to "
#~ "open it immediately. If fzf is "
#~ "unavailable or incompatible, a bounded "
#~ "case-insensitive substring menu is computed"
#~ " in the background instead, so "
#~ "scanning a large repository never blocks"
#~ " typing. Pasting an already complete "
#~ "mention does not open a picker."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "只输入 `@` 会列出三种类型，补全后插入带 namespace "
#~ "的形式。Repository 文件不会混进这个菜单。将光标放在 `@file:<query>` 中并按"
#~ " `Tab`：安装了 `fzf` 时，minacode 会打开一个预填查询的真实 "
#~ "fzf session。如果 fzf 不可用或不兼容，则在后台计算一个有数量上限、不区分大小写的 "
#~ "substring 菜单，因此扫描大型 repository 绝不会阻塞输入。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Three inline references. Typing `@` or"
#~ " `$` opens a bounded namespace, MCP,"
