#~ msgstr "三种行内引用。输入 `@` 或 `$` 会打开有数量上限的 namespace、MCP 和 skill 列表，并随着继续输入不断收窄："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Typing `@` lists the three kinds. "
#~ "Selecting one opens its candidates, "
#~ "which narrow as you type. Files "
#~ "stay out of this first list: "
#~ "typing or selecting `@file:` opens fzf"
