#~ msgid ""
#~ "`ToolScript` calls are listed here too."
#~ " Selecting one opens its complete "
#~ "script in a scrolling, syntax-"
#~ "highlighted viewer — the only way "
#~ "to read a script under `--yolo`, "
#~ "where no confirmation prompt stops to"
#~ " offer `v`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`ToolScript` 的调用也会列在这里。选中其中一条会在可滚动、带语法高亮的查看器中打开完整脚本 —— "
#~ "在 `--yolo` 下这是读到脚本的唯一途径，因为那里没有任何确认提示会停下来提供 `v`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The working divider above the prompt "
#~ "names the current phase — `thinking`,"
#~ " `responding`, or `web search` while "
#~ "a [provider-side tool](tools.md#provider-"
#~ "side-tools) runs inside the request."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "提示符上方的工作分隔线会显示当前阶段——`thinking`、`responding`，以及 [Provider "
#~ "侧工具](tools.md#provider-side-tools)在请求内部执行时的 `web "
#~ "search`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Tab` cycles between the input and "
#~ "the chips. `Enter` on a chip picks"
#~ " it into the input and returns "
#~ "to the prompt, so `Tab` to the "
#~ "next chip and `Enter` again combines "
#~ "several suggestions; a final `Enter` "
#~ "sends. Focus a picked chip and "
#~ "press `Enter` to unpick it. Editing "
#~ "the text normally clears the chip "
#~ "selection state. Quick hints are always"
#~ " available at the TUI prompt."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Tab` 在输入框和 chip 之间循环切换。在 chip 上按 "
#~ "`Enter` 可将它选入输入框并返回提示符，因此 `Tab` 移到下一个 chip "
#~ "再按 `Enter` 即可组合多条建议；最后按一次 `Enter` 发送。重新聚焦已选中的"
#~ " chip 并按 `Enter` 可取消选中。正常编辑文本会清除 chip "
#~ "选择状态。快速建议会在 TUI 提示符中始终可用。"

